 catching orange sodium-neon glow. Directional light carves deep shadows across the subject, background rendered almost abstract, blurred by pencil strokes and smudges as if reality itself recedes into atmospheric haze. Slightly off-angle handheld framing, motion blur in the background, a stolen instant mid-stride. Mood: haunting yet magnetic, oppressive, beautiful decay, an intellectual brooding suspended between contemplation and danger. El sujeto, el objetivo, captura toda la foto:"], "color": "#223", "bgcolor": "#335"}, {"id": 11, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "pos": [-560, 400], "size": [458.21875, 337.375], "flags": {}, "order": 2, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "value", "name": "value", "type": "STRING", "widget": {"name": "value"}, "link": null}], "outputs": [{"localized_name": "STRING", "name": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [13]}], "title": "2 PROMPT - Character (variable per portrait)", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "cnr_id": "comfy-core"}, "widgets_values": ["Ella es una monja que camina sola en la noche, con su falda amplia pegada al cuerpo.\n\nSu figura es hermosa en la tela y la humedad, su cola parada, su caminar a pasos largos mientras la c\u00e1mara captura la escena. Lleva unas botas negras estilo militar futurista sin tacos, y no se ve pierna antes de la falda, pero el contorno de sus piernas torna brillo en el negro hermoso de su ropa.\n\nSus brazos torneados se sacuden en su andar.\n\nEl oscuro y viejo ladrillo del fondo es de unos barrios de mala muerte, pero la confianza de la monja de batalla es evidente."], "color": "#432", "bgcolor": "#653"}, {"id": 12, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "pos": [-560, 810], "size": [460, 160], "flags": {}, "order": 3, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "value", "name": "value", "type": "STRING", "widget": {"name": "value"}, "link": null}], "outputs": [{"localized_name": "STRING", "name": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "slot_index"